            "  original_init(self, **validated_kwargs)\n",
            "c:\\Users\\user\\miniconda3\\envs\\cv\\Lib\\site-packages\\albumentations\\core\\composition.py:331: UserWarning: Got processor for bboxes, but no transform to process it.\n",
